{title: 683 - Jesus, Stand Among Us}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #683 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 683}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F/C]Jesus, [C]stand among [F/A]us
[Dm/A]In Thy risen [C]power;
[C]Let [Am]this [Bb]time [C7]of [F/C]worship
[F/C]Be a [Gm/D]hallowed [Dm/A]hour.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F/C]Breathe the [C]Holy [Dm/A]Spirit
[Dm/A]Into every [F/C]heart;
[C]Bid [Am]the [Bb]fears [C7]and [F/C]sorrows
[F/C]From each [Gm/D]soul [C]depart.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F/C]Thus with [C]quickened [Dm/A]footsteps
[Dm/A]We pursue [C]our way,
[C]Watching [Bb]for [C7]the [F/C]dawning
[F/C]Of eternal [Dm/A]day.
{end_of_verse}
